Attribution: "Subnet Legibility Index by Mikyö Clark, legible.network" for the
index, "Bittensor Narrative Map by Mikyö Clark, legible.network" for the map.
Quotations inside the narrative dataset remain the words of the people quoted;
each is at most 60 words, attributed, dated, and linked to its source.
